# Acme Brand Style Guide

## Colors
- Primary: #1A73E8 (Blue)
- Secondary: #34A853 (Green)
- Accent: #EA4335 (Red)

## Typography
- Headings: Inter, sans-serif
- Body: Source Sans Pro, 16px
- Code: JetBrains Mono

## Logo Usage
- Minimum clear space: 24px
- Never stretch or skew
- Use primary logo on light backgrounds, dark logo on dark backgrounds

## Voice & Tone
- Professional but approachable
- Active voice, present tense
- Avoid jargon -- write for a general audience
